# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Netlify Redirects & API Proxy Config
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 1. Proxy relative API requests to Netlify Serverless Functions
/api/*  /.netlify/functions/api  200

# 2. Support client-side routing in Single Page Apps (React Router)
#    Redirects all other requests to index.html
/*      /index.html                                      200
